== Usage == <!--T:7-->

<!--T:8-->
This template can be used to document API parameters.
<!--T:9--> Its intent is to harmonize the appearance of template parameters across all of the API pages.

{{Pre2|style=display:inline-block
|1=<nowiki>{{ApiParam
|</nowiki>''name=''<nowiki>
|</nowiki>''description=''<nowiki>
|required=
|maxallowed=
|maxallowedbot=
|type=
|values=
|default=
|version=
|deprecated=
|removed=
}}</nowiki>}}

{{(}}{{!}} class="wikitable sortable"
! colspan=2 {{!}} <!--T:17--> ApiParam parameters
{{!}}-
! <!--T:18--> Parameter Name !! <!--T:19--> Description
{{!}}-
{{!}} <code>'''name'''</code> ''<!--T:20--> (or first unnamed)'' {{!}}{{!}} <!--T:21--> The parameter name (required).
{{!}}-
{{!}} <code>description</code> ''<!--T:22--> (or second unnamed)'' {{!}}{{!}} <!--T:23--> A description of the parameter.
{{!}}-
{{!}} <code>required</code> {{!}}{{!}} <!--T:24--> Specify a value if the parameter is required. <!--T:25--> The name of the required parameter will be bolded.
{{!}}-
{{!}} <code>maxallowed</code> {{!}}{{!}} <!--T:26--> For pipe-separated values or numeric quantities, the maximum allowed.
{{!}}-
{{!}} <code>maxallowedbot</code> {{!}}{{!}} <!--T:27--> As above, for bots. <!--T:28--> If 50 or 500 is used for <code>maxallowed</code>, this will default to 500 or 5000, respectively.
{{!}}-
{{!}} <code>type</code> {{!}}{{!}} <!--T:29--> The data type of the parameter.
{{!}}-
{{!}} <code>values</code> {{!}}{{!}} <!--T:30--> A list of possible values for the parameter.
{{!}}-
{{!}} <code>default</code> {{!}}{{!}} <!--T:31--> The default value for the parameter.
{{!}}-
{{!}} <code>version</code> {{!}}{{!}} <!--T:32--> The version the parameter was introduced in. <!--T:33--> Use the plain MediaWiki version number only.
{{!}}-
{{!}} <code>deprecated</code> {{!}}{{!}} <!--T:34--> The version the parameter was deprecated in. <!--T:35--> Use the plain MediaWiki version number only.
{{!}}-
{{!}} <code>removed</code> {{!}}{{!}} <!--T:36--> The version the parameter was removed in. <!--T:37--> Use the plain MediaWiki version number only.
{{!}}{{)}}


